#
# The Python packages that only the Docker image installs, in addition to requirements.txt. pip-compile pins them
# with hashes in requirements-image.txt. The command is in the header of that file. It reads requirements.txt as a
# constraint, so that the packages that both files need keep the versions of requirements.txt.

# The PostgreSQL driver for postgresql+psycopg2:// database URIs, as a prebuilt wheel
psycopg2-binary
# The WSGI server of the image
gunicorn
# The Oracle driver for oracle+oracledb:// database URIs. Its thin mode needs no Oracle client libraries.
oracledb
